    "action": "reuse_contract",
    "summary": "The release adds native Codex Responses through the companion daemon, the per-caller rate limit, the access log and metrics, request and audit listings with their console pages, and the static-key deprecation switch. Every accepted proposition holds for this source; the console and metrics propositions rest on changed implementations, which the exploratory run and the release smoke exercise."
